{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","kind":"episodes","input":{"mediaId":42410,"seasonNumber":1},"checkedAt":1793470669389,"status":"ok","retryCount":0,"value":{"seasonNumber":1,"name":{"value":"Stagione 1","language":"it-IT"},"year":2010,"episodeCount":24,"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fE7khzTnT0KqukpkabruwRjmbn7.jpg","posters":[],"backgrounds":[],"episodes":[{"id":"879919","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":1,"title":{"value":"Episodio 1","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mikado, a young man longing for something unusual in his life, moves to Ikebukuro at the invitation of his childhood friend Masaomi. Arriving in Tokyo, he begins his new life as a high school student, awed and mesmerized by the new world around him.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-08","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nrRpmcSrCNWurdXQv7lMmNzDpYn.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/nrRpmcSrCNWurdXQv7lMmNzDpYn.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/1"},{"id":"879934","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":2,"title":{"value":"Episodio 2","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It is the Entrance Ceremony at Raira Academy, and the auditorium swells with a varied mix of emotions emitted from the students. Amidst all this is Rio Kamichika: a girl with a notably dark vibe following her.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-15","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.9,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/PgufIzFHgBuIs9EI1TzWch3GdQ.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/PgufIzFHgBuIs9EI1TzWch3GdQ.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/2"},{"id":"879935","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":3,"title":{"value":"Episodio 3","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Masaomi Kida is out about town, fervently trying to pick up girls, while Mikado tags along, feeling a bit confused and bewildered. Various people intermingle throughout Ikebukuro as rumors of the “Dollars” spread.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-22","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.6,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/t0amH7hycNULBAURpEJ9qqlxaPT.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/t0amH7hycNULBAURpEJ9qqlxaPT.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/3"},{"id":"879936","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":4,"title":{"value":"Episodio 4","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"People throughout the city speak of an urban legend known as the “Headless Rider”. A surprising number of people have personally witnessed it speeding down the streets on a jet-black motorbike with no license plate.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-01-29","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7Qq35dEUXare65PubckYdIRl9iM.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7Qq35dEUXare65PubckYdIRl9iM.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/4"},{"id":"879937","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":5,"title":{"value":"Episodio 5","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"While hanging out with Anri, Mikado and Kida learn about her worries for her missing friend and try to cheer her up. Later the duo gets themselves in trouble when they are cornered by a gang of thugs.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-02-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tqs4II7bqj4r6uB4MvkH8sM84uu.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tqs4II7bqj4r6uB4MvkH8sM84uu.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/5"},{"id":"879938","seasonNumber":1,"episod