9942","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":9,"title":{"value":"Episodio 9","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After losing contact with her brother Seiji, Namie Yagiri enlists Izaya's help to find him. While roaming through Ikebukuro, Seiji and Mika Harima stumble onto Shizuo and Celty and a heated pursuit begins after Celty figures that the head attached to Mika's body is actually hers.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-05","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":6.8,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9So9E4yOezwH1dWGScu3J4W9Zsr.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9So9E4yOezwH1dWGScu3J4W9Zsr.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/9"},{"id":"879922","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":10,"title":{"value":"Episodio 10","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Mikado runs away with Mika and shelters her into his apartment. However, in the following day, he is approached by Celty and Izaya, and after telling her secret to him, Celty convinces Mikado to help her find Mika. Unfortunately, Mikado is cornered by some Yagiri Pharmacy workers who question him on Mika's whereabouts. In order to save Mika, Mikado reveals to Izaya and Celty his secret.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-12","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/b7X4hskWsCW8qd03rWx7LM6v53K.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b7X4hskWsCW8qd03rWx7LM6v53K.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/10"},{"id":"879924","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":11,"title":{"value":"Episodio 11","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anri's missing friend, the Dullahan, the girl with the scar on her neck, Yagiri Pharmaceuticals, the kidnappings, and the Dollars... little by little, the pieces begin to fall into place.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-19","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/dAYYrKycp4QXL0sttqcaO8T3T85.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dAYYrKycp4QXL0sttqcaO8T3T85.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/11"},{"id":"879941","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":12,"title":{"value":"Episodio 12","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"It is discovered that Harima Mika is actually alive, and that Celty's head is being held by Yagiri Pharmacy. Shinra had known about it, and kept the secret from Celty for the fear of losing her because of her head's will.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-03-26","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/q519RUwZ5wZTvmHeyItf47pfQNc.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q519RUwZ5wZTvmHeyItf47pfQNc.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/12"},{"id":"879923","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":13,"title":{"value":"Episodio 13","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Half a year has passed since the Dollars meeting and Ikebukuro seems to have returned to normal. But underground, the Yellow Scarves and the Slasher are becoming increasingly active. Darkness approaches, ready to destroy the days of peace.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-09","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/v086wDdhLJ19JpDgxXiEHaveLMy.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/v086wDdhLJ19JpDgxXiEHaveLMy.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/13"},{"id":"879925","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":14,"title":{"value":"Episodio 14","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anri is attacked by the Slasher. The same night, the user Saika appears in the chatroom, and posts a puzzling message. Mikado, worried about rumors that the Slashers are the Dollars, decides to cooperate with Celty.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-16","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/deDOmEfYwU7RGnqNIn4BB6inEK7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/deDOmEfYwU7RGnqNIn4BB6inEK7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/14"},{"id":"879926","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":15,"title":{"value":"Episodio 15","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Magazine Journalist Shuji Niekawa’s unbridled passion is raging. A Russian who runs a sushi shop, the Awakusu organization, an Information Broker, the Headless Rider... He investigates the supposedly strongest man in Ikebukuro: Shizuo Heiwajima.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-23","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kCLadRV0YfZ054vbZb3tEB34Z1y.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kCLadRV0YfZ054vbZb3tEB34Z1y.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/15"},{"id":"879921","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":16,"title":{"value":"Episodio 16","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anri is targeted by the Slasher, but Kyohei’s gang moves to rescue her. Shizuo and Celty join in, and after defeating the Slasher, reveal his true identity. However, this moment of relief doesn’t last as Celty reads what has been posted in the chatroom.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-04-30","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/a1um1yCt8w4KXBOYTej6PpM1Xi9.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/a1um1yCt8w4KXBOYTej6PpM1Xi9.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/16"},{"id":"879920","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":17,"title":{"value":"Episodio 17","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"As Anri faces off against Haruna, truths about her past are revealed. Elsewhere, Shizuo fights an unending battle against the Slashers in South Ikebukuro Park. As he defeats them one after another, his expression starts to take on a hint of joy.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-07","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.4,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AvgR4Vd3FEgtYt3rsNmN3zvxp1g.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AvgR4Vd3FEgtYt3rsNmN3zvxp1g.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/17"},{"id":"879927","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":18,"title":{"value":"Episodio 18","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Civil unrest begins to descend upon Ikebukuro. Masaomi finds himself in an abandoned building, depressed, thinking about his past: how he ended up back there, and how a girl still waits for him at a hospital.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-14","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/vfbQBn2rC9cD6oTcstg6CPie7mR.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vfbQBn2rC9cD6oTcstg6CPie7mR.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/18"},{"id":"879928","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":19,"title":{"value":"Episodio 19","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Anri notices something is wrong with Masaomi, and takes action to find out what it is. Elsewhere, a gang-war breaks out between the Yellow Scarves and the Dollars over the Slasher’s identity. The standoff grows as Mikado’s desire to stop it is ignored.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-21","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/tGWIZQPr2IJDkXIlFZVK2BE55fi.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/tGWIZQPr2IJDkXIlFZVK2BE55fi.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/19"},{"id":"879929","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":20,"title":{"value":"Episodio 20","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"After doing some investigating, Masaomi starts to suspect that the remnants of the Blue Squares, a gang that he once fought, have slipped into the Dollars. He decides to visit Kyohei’s gang to learn the truth.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-05-28","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cluT4AjGC0dJFTkzyFDdfITf6EG.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cluT4AjGC0dJFTkzyFDdfITf6EG.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/20"},{"id":"879930","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":21,"title":{"value":"Episodio 21","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Despite Mikado’s orders, the Yellow Scarves hunt down members of the Dollars. Mikado begins to question whether the existence of the Dollars is worth such a sacrifice. Anri tries to put a stop to the gang war, but ends up making the situation worse...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-06-04","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/mtsQ5s0EAFWoHZp3TOKUTk2YGWo.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/mtsQ5s0EAFWoHZp3TOKUTk2YGWo.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/21"},{"id":"879931","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":22,"title":{"value":"Episodio 22","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"The Dollars are enraged at the Yellow Scarves’ actions. The Yellow Scarves learn that Anri is the girl who escaped from their hideout during the night of the meeting, and track her down. However, an unexpected group of people steps in to save her...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-06-11","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/kRuKi3EIs8c6doZlPoHGHpMBwIF.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kRuKi3EIs8c6doZlPoHGHpMBwIF.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/22"},{"id":"879932","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":23,"title":{"value":"Episodio 23","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"A gunshot resounds from an alley, echoed by a phone call for Masaomi. Mikado rides with Celty, and Anri learns the truth. Their hearts are filled with trust, doubt, and unease. Everything rushes toward a conclusion, and Izaya enjoys the chaos.","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-06-18","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pQWKqCmkcHN4yPHFIBFGkaBROQ7.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pQWKqCmkcHN4yPHFIBFGkaBROQ7.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/23"},{"id":"879933","seasonNumber":1,"episodeNumber":24,"title":{"value":"Episodio 24","language":"it-IT"},"overview":{"value":"Filled with unwavering determination, Masaomi enters the abandoned factory, and encounters the unexpected. At last: Masaomi, Mikado, and Anri face off. Although each of them carries inexpressible feelings, they eventually find an answer...","language":"en-US"},"airDateText":{"value":"2010-06-25","language":"it-IT"},"runtimeMinutes":24,"rating":7.2,"thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/AbIlefUmZIkNzajL0GimzuEmdg4.jpg","stills":[{"type":"still","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AbIlefUmZIkNzajL0GimzuEmdg4.jpg","language":"xx"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/season/1/episode/24"}],"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/42410/sea